 Nexus  Overview  Wi-Fi  Ethernet  VPN  Hotspot  Settings                                  ● Online
╭ Connections ─────╭ All keys (j/k scroll) ─────────────────────────────────────╮──────────────────╮
│ ▸ ● Wi-Fi        │  :                    Open the command palette             █░  ░░░░░░░░       │
│     Home-5G      │  j / k, Down / Up     Move in the list                     ██░░████████░░     │
│   ○ Ethernet     │  g / G                Jump to top / bottom                 ██░░██░░░░░░       │
│     Not connected│  h / l, Left / Right  Previous / next tab                  ██░░██████░░       │
│   ○ VPN          │  Tab / Shift-Tab      Next / previous tab                  ██░░██░░░░░░       │
│     Not connected│  1 - 6                Jump to a tab                        ██░░████████░░     │
│   ○ Hotspot      │  Enter                Open the selected card's tab         █░  ░░░░░░░░       │
│     Not started  │  d                    Details sheet (small windows)        █                  │
│                  │  Esc                  Back out; never quits                █ks healthy.       │
│                  │  o                    Open a Portal's login page           │                  │
│                  │  f                    Overview: run the fix (asks first)   │──────────────────╯
│                  │  ?                    Show or hide this help               │──────────────────╮
│                  │  q                    Quit (Ctrl-C works anywhere)         │⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ │
│                  │  Wi-Fi: Enter         Join the selected Network            │⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀ │
│                  │  Wi-Fi: r             Rescan                               │⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ │
│                  │  Wi-Fi: x             Disconnect                           │⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀ │
│                  │  Wi-Fi: f             Forget (asks first)                  │──────────────────╯
│                  │  Wi-Fi: a             Toggle autoconnect                   │──────────────────╮
│                  │  Wi-Fi: t             Mark Trusted or Untrusted            │                  │
│                  │  Wi-Fi: e             Edit the Profile's settings          │                  │
│                  │  Wi-Fi: s             Share as a QR code (asks first)      │                  │
│                  │  VPN: Enter           Bring the VPN up or down             │                  │
│                  │  VPN: i               Import a WireGuard .conf             │                  │
│                  │  VPN: c               Create a WireGuard VPN with new keys │                  │
